fixture air_control_after_air_reversal
doc BUILD.md s5 Jump "Air control: 0 to max in 8 f": an earlier reversal in the air leaves no boosted acceleration behind (the ground turnaround's 2-frame catch-up is ground only and counts down)
room test/shaft
spawn 760 300
frames 40
input
